======================================================================
INDEPENDENT ADVERSARIAL VERIFICATION: hopfield-fubini-hebbian
======================================================================

--- TEST A: is c3 EXACTLY degree<=2 in tile bits? (basis-free Mobius test) ---
(no Hopfield assumed; we just compute multilinear coeffs of brute-force c3)
  n=3: F=1, 2^F=2 tilings, max multilinear degree of c3 = 1  ; #coeffs of order>=3 = 0  => QUADRATIC (deg<=2)
  n=4: F=3, 2^F=8 tilings, max multilinear degree of c3 = 2  ; #coeffs of order>=3 = 0  => QUADRATIC (deg<=2)
  n=5: F=6, 2^F=64 tilings, max multilinear degree of c3 = 2  ; #coeffs of order>=3 = 0  => QUADRATIC (deg<=2)
  n=6: F=10, 2^F=1024 tilings, max multilinear degree of c3 = 2  ; #coeffs of order>=3 = 0  => QUADRATIC (deg<=2)
  n=7: F=15, 2^F=32768; sampled 2000 3rd-diff triples, nonzero (deg>=3 evidence)=0  => QUADRATIC (deg<=2)

--- TEST B: c3 ground state (max) = regular tournament? (THM-027) ---
  n=3: max c3=1; maximizer score multiset(s)=[(1, 1, 1)]  regular=(1, 1, 1) -> MATCH
  n=4: max c3=2; maximizer score multiset(s)=[(1, 1, 2, 2)]  (even n: near-regular)
  n=5: max c3=5; maximizer score multiset(s)=[(2, 2, 2, 2, 2)]  regular=(2, 2, 2, 2, 2) -> MATCH
  n=6: max c3=8; maximizer score multiset(s)=[(2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3)]  (even n: near-regular)
  n=7: max c3=14; maximizer score multiset(s)=[(3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3)]  regular=(3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3) -> MATCH

--- TEST C: is H (full OCF Hamiltonian-path count) degree<=2? residual = magic gap ---
  n=3: F=1; best-quadratic max|H-Qfit| = 0 (=0.0)  ; exact multilinear deg(H)=1
  n=4: F=3; best-quadratic max|H-Qfit| = 0 (=0.0)  ; exact multilinear deg(H)=2
  n=5: F=6; best-quadratic max|H-Qfit| = 15/8 (=1.875)  ; exact multilinear deg(H)=4
  n=6: F=10; best-quadratic max|H-Qfit| = 11 (=11.0)  ; exact multilinear deg(H)=4

--- TEST D: Hopfield greedy ascent basin fractions on c3 (fresh code) ---
  n=4: global c3-max=2; greedy reached it 300/300 = 1.000 ; final-c3 hist={2: 300}
  n=5: global c3-max=5; greedy reached it 202/300 = 0.673 ; final-c3 hist={4: 98, 5: 202}
  n=6: global c3-max=8; greedy reached it 300/300 = 1.000 ; final-c3 hist={8: 300}
  n=7: global c3-max=14; greedy reached it 174/300 = 0.580 ; final-c3 hist={13: 126, 14: 174}

--- TEST E: sanity check H = 1 + 2*c3 + 4*c5disjoint... at the regular/Paley point ---
  n=5: H >= 1+2*c3 on 200 random tilings: OK
  n=7: H >= 1+2*c3 on 200 random tilings: OK
